I'm your host as always, David Bernard, and with me today, Jacob Eiting, co host.

6
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,320
Say hello, Jacob.

7
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,320
Oh, David, it's a it's a beautiful day.

8
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:29,360
It is.

9
